{"reviewer_participant_id": "actor:stage2-cross-model-fable-01", "calibration_results": [{"calibration_case_id": "calibration:complete-frame-mismatch", "verdict": "demonstrated_issue", "invented_material_premise": false, "evidence_basis": "stated_evidence_only", "rationale": "Registered target is the rate over all 100 planned locations, but the only selected result uses a 73-location post-screening denominator and reports it as the planned-region rate with no amendment or approved deviation. Falsification attempt: the mismatch would dissolve only if the conditional frame were authorized, which the vignette explicitly negates; thus a denominator/frame mismatch is directly entailed."}, {"calibration_case_id": "calibration:conditional-subset-scope", "verdict": "no_demonstrated_issue_within_scope", "invented_material_premise": false, "evidence_basis": "stated_evidence_only", "rationale": "The registered target is explicitly conditional on the 73 signal-eligible locations, the result uses exactly those 73, and all claims are limited to that scope. Falsification attempt: an issue would require a claim exceeding the conditional scope or a frame mismatch; the stated evidence excludes both, so no issue is demonstrated within scope."}, {"calibration_case_id": "calibration:full-frame-accounting", "verdict": "no_demonstrated_issue_within_scope", "invented_material_premise": false, "evidence_basis": "stated_evidence_only", "rationale": "Target covers all 100 planned locations; the result keeps all 100 in the denominator, documents the 27 unavailable measurements, and reports the full-frame rate. Falsification attempt: an issue would require denominator shrinkage or unrecorded missingness; the stated evidence shows neither, so the frame matches the target."}, {"calibration_case_id": "calibration:unrelated-quality-endpoint", "verdict": "no_demonstrated_issue_within_scope", "invented_material_premise": false, "evidence_basis": "stated_evidence_only", "rationale": "The scientific result uses all 100 planned locations; the 73-record pass fraction is a separate QC table explicitly excluded from the scientific endpoint. Falsification attempt: an issue would require the QC subset to leak into the scientific claim; the stated exclusion rules that out, so no scoped issue is demonstrated."}, {"calibration_case_id": "calibration:conflicting-scope-records", "verdict": "conditional_or_unknown", "invented_material_premise": false, "evidence_basis": "stated_evidence_only", "rationale": "Two equally authoritative signed plans conflict (all planned vs. signal-eligible locations) with no precedence rule; the result uses eligible locations. Falsification attempt: to demonstrate an issue I would need evidence that the all-locations plan governs, and to clear the case I would need evidence the eligible-locations plan governs; neither is stated, so the correct frame remains materially unknown."}, {"calibration_case_id": "calibration:no-selected-result", "verdict": "insufficient_evidence", "invented_material_premise": false, "evidence_basis": "stated_evidence_only", "rationale": "The repository can emit multiple runtime-argument-selected reports and the preserved record does not establish which report, if any, backs the scientific claim. Falsification attempt: any verdict on issue presence requires identifying the selected result; without that record there is no evaluable result-to-target linkage, so evidence is insufficient."}]}